    ///
    ///Sends a `GET` request to
    /// `/Artists/{name}/Images/{imageType}/{imageIndex}`
    ///
    ///Arguments:
    /// - `name`: Artist name.
    /// - `image_type`: Image type.
    /// - `image_index`: Image index.
    /// - `background_color`: Optional. Apply a background color for transparent
    ///   images.
    /// - `blur`: Optional. Blur image.
    /// - `fill_height`: Height of box to fill.
    /// - `fill_width`: Width of box to fill.
    /// - `foreground_layer`: Optional. Apply a foreground layer on top of the
    ///   image.
    /// - `format`: Determines the output format of the image -
    ///   original,gif,jpg,png.
    /// - `height`: The fixed image height to return.
    /// - `max_height`: The maximum image height to return.
    /// - `max_width`: The maximum image width to return.
    /// - `percent_played`: Optional. Percent to render for the percent played
    ///   overlay.
    /// - `quality`: Optional. Quality setting, from 0-100. Defaults to 90 and
    ///   should suffice in most cases.
    /// - `tag`: Optional. Supply the cache tag from the item object to receive
    ///   strong caching headers.
    /// - `unplayed_count`: Optional. Unplayed count overlay to render.
    /// - `width`: The fixed image width to return.
    ///```ignore
    /// let response = client.get_artist_image()
    ///    .name(name)
    ///    .image_type(image_type)
    ///    .image_index(image_index)
