    /// - `enable_total_record_count`: Optional. Enable the total record count.
    /// - `enable_user_data`: Optional. Include user data.
    /// - `exclude_active_sessions`: Optional. Whether to exclude the currently
    ///   active sessions.
    /// - `exclude_item_types`: Optional. If specified, results will be filtered
    ///   based on item type. This allows multiple, comma delimited.
    /// - `fields`: Optional. Specify additional fields of information to return
    ///   in the output. This allows multiple, comma delimited. Options: Budget,
    ///   Chapters, DateCreated, Genres, HomePageUrl, IndexOptions,
    ///   MediaStreams, Overview, ParentId, Path, People, ProviderIds,
