    /// - `is_sports`: Optional. Filter for sports.
    /// - `library_series_id`: Optional. Filter by library series id.
    /// - `limit`: Optional. The maximum number of records to return.
    /// - `max_end_date`: Optional. The maximum premiere end date.
    /// - `max_start_date`: Optional. The maximum premiere start date.
    /// - `min_end_date`: Optional. The minimum premiere end date.
    /// - `min_start_date`: Optional. The minimum premiere start date.
    /// - `series_timer_id`: Optional. Filter by series timer id.
    /// - `sort_by`: Optional. Specify one or more sort orders, comma delimited.
    ///   Options: Name, StartDate.
